# What the daily-web deployment actually needs.
#
# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `web`, and its build is `next build`
# against artifacts that are already committed under `web/public/`. Nothing
# else in this repository takes part: the backend is a stateful daemon that
# runs on its own host, and the iOS app is not a web artifact. Without this
# file the CLI uploads 1.8 GB of virtualenv, Xcode project and local caches to
# build a static site, which is slow enough to time out.

/backend
/Daily
/DailyTests
/DailyUITests
/Daily.xcodeproj
/scripts
/docs
/.context
/.conductor
/.github
/.claude

node_modules
.next
out
*.tsbuildinfo
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
